# Generated 3D assets.
#
# assets/tripo holds the source of record and is committed: generation is not
# deterministic, so a lost GLB cannot be re-made from its prompt.
#
# public/tripo is the serving copy the dev comparison harness reads, and Vite
# copies everything in public/ into the build. The game does not load these
# yet, so committing it would put 26 MB of unused payload in front of every
# visitor. Recreate it with: cp assets/tripo/*.glb public/tripo/
assets/tripo/*.task.json
assets/tripo/*.rejected
public/tripo/
